      en: "Or Akiva is a small city in the Haifa District of Israel, founded in 1951. With a population of about 19,000, it is primarily a residential suburb. The city has some light industry and commercial areas. Or Akiva has undergone development programs to improve housing and public services. It is located near the ancient site of Caesarea and the main highway to Tel Aviv. The city lacks a railway station, relying on bus services. Community life centers around the local cultural center and sports facilities.",
